    {
      "id": "text-3",
      "type": "text",
      "content": {
        "heading": "Drowning in Plastic",
        "body": "Plastic waste is choking our seas and coasts, threatening ecosystems and livelihoods in South-East Asia.\n\n‍\n\nPlastic pollutes our soil, our waterways, our ocean, and our food. It directly harms marine life, causes billions of dollars of damage to shipping, fishing and tourism, and threatens our health.\n\n‍\n\nThe most severe impacts of environmental degradation will be felt by young people, future generations, and disadvantaged groups. Preventing plastic pollution is a human rights issue.\n\n‍"
      },
      "padTop": "4-5",
      "padBottom": "4-5"
    },
